OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into brook's 'milky
OL,4,Aappearance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into what caused a brook
OL,8,Fin Leicestershire to take on a "milky
OL,9,Fappearance".
OL,11,FConcerns were raised on social media
OL,12,Flast week after residents spotted what
OL,13,Fappeared to be a white liquid flowing
OL,14,Ffrom a pipe beneath Oakcroft Avenue
OL,15,FBridge, towards Kirby Muxloe Castle at
OL,16,FKirby Brook.
OL,18,FSevern Trent said it had been working
OL,19,Fwith the Environment Agency since
OL,20,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
